window.products.push({"id":596121,"name":"Palmtreechef - Set of 4 Extra Large Tall Airtight Dry Food Storage Container- 176oz/5.2L - Great for Flour, Sugar, Cereal, Pasta, Baking -Bpa Free - 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.1,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d9oDvGbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is Aaron from PalmTreeChef and I am a professional organizer with a penchant for plastic containers. Not just any containers… they have to be the best and do the job to a very high standard. Our kitchen storage containers are THE BEST because they have been designed by professionals with obsessive tendencies! I kid you not!!!! What’s so special? Here are just some of the benefits of using the PalmTreeChef storage containers over lesser quality options * Made from the highest quality, non-toxic, BPA free plastic. * Freezer safe. * All our lids close hermetically tight 100% of the time keeping food fresh for longer. * Dishwasher safe - regardless of how many times you wash them in the dishwasher, they will never become cloudy! * The built-in measure helps you to plan your shopping down to the last ounce. * Can be used as a measuring cup. * The special ergonomic, easy to hold design reduces the chance of spilling so there is less waste and less cleanup. * Children find them especially easy to use giving them independence and you peace of mind. * Buy in bulk to save time and money knowing that you store and use only what you need.* Perfect size to fit any shelf. * Esthetic with fun colored lids so they can be displayed on the countertop in the kitchen or pantry or placed on top of the fridge. * We provide you with 24 free chalkboard stickers so that you can tell the difference between lookalike foods such as flour / cornflour / confectioners’ sugar / salt or pet food / Coco Puffs! Change the contents of the containers as many times as you like using the erasable pen.  Also comes with 6 measuring cups * Comes in a gift box so you can treat your loved ones to the gift of stress free organization. BUY NOW! There is absolutely no risk as this product comes with a lifetime guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81d9oDvGbsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"brand","source_asin":"B07QBB7PYT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596121","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QBB7PYT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QBB7PYT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
