window.products.push({"id":596180,"name":"ALWAYS AZUL POTTERY Laughing Skull Mug with Spoon in Coral - Handmade Ceramic Coffee Mug - Stylish and Unique Handcrafted Artistic Drinkware - Polishe","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gDqxAJpFL._AC_.jpg","description":"HANDCRAFTED WITH CARE: Each mug is made by hand with great attention to detail, ensuring that every piece is unique and has its own character. With its intricate design and vibrant color, this mug will stand out in your collection. STYLISH AND UNIQUE DESIGN: The Always Azul Pottery Mug features a stylish and eye-catching design that is sure to make a statement in any kitchen. Whether you're enjoying your morning coffee or afternoon tea, this mug is an excellent way to add a touch of style to your day. MAKES A GREAT GIFT: The Always Azul Pottery Mug is a versatile and thoughtful gift option for any occasion, be it a birthday, holiday, or just a treat for oneself. Its stunning design and practicality make it an excellent choice for anyone who appreciates beautiful and functional objects. Whether you want to show someone you care or simply indulge in a little self-care, this mug is an excellent choice. MADE FROM EXCELLENT QUALITY POTTERY: Our mugs are crafted with care from excellent quality pottery that is durable and designed to last. Each of our handmade mugs is uniquely built to endure the everyday wear and tear of usage. This means that you can savor your morning coffee or tea for years to come with the added benefit of knowing that you're supporting an artisan who takes pride in their craft. GREAT FOR ANY TYPE OF DRINKER: Whether you're a coffee or tea drinker, this mug is great for any type of drink. Its sturdy construction and a comfortable handle make it easy to hold, while the generous size ensures that you can enjoy a full cup of your favorite beverage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41gDqxAJpFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ALWAYS AZUL POTTERY","source_asin":"B004G1X4E8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596180","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004G1X4E8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004G1X4E8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":596181,"name":"AzureGreen Jericho Flowers (1 flower)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gp5pjiBXL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Selaginella lepidophylla, also known as the Rose of Jericho, the Resurrection Flower, or Jericho Flowers, are so named as they seem to come to life after they die. They survive, curled up dormant and brown and appear to the untrained eye to be dead for years. Once it comes into contact with water that it can find nutrients in, however, it expands and turns green, springing to life and blooming before curling back up when the water is depleted. This cycle can last for years and years, and has given rise to the tradition of keeping one dormant in one's home and bringing it out around Christmas time. During this time, it is watered, and brought to life before it is allowed again to wither with the passing of the holiday. This is said to symbolize Mary's delivery of Christ, and the plant used in this tradition is often passed down through the family over the years. Outside of Christmas traditions, it is most commonly used in spiritual practices, where it is said to have particular use in love spells, either where one is seeking to bring to life a love that died or create love where there previously was not any. Some herbalists also attribute the Jericho Flower with the ability to purify blood, often helping to ease the symptoms of illnesses and fevers. This packet contains one Jericho Flower.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gp5pjiBXL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AzureGreen","source_asin":"B000VV02QA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VV02QA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VV02QA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
