window.products.push({"id":596206,"name":"Kingfun Accent Chairs for Bedroom, Midcentury Modern Accent Arm Chair for Living Room, Linen Fabric Comfy Reading Chair, Tufted Comfortable Sofa Chair","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":169.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dhuWeh9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【STURDY AND DURABLE】Are you bothered by the easy damage of a common single sofa? The frame of living room chair is made of durable solid wood which can easily hold up to 300 pound. And the flared solid wood legs not only increase the stability of the sofa chair but also provide additional security. There are non-slip pads at the bottom to prevent the armchair from sliding and scratching the floor. 【UPHOLSTERED SEAT】The accent chair can create a comfortable environment to rest or work. The interior of our comfortable chair adopted a thick high-density and high-resilient native sponge which is softer and more elastic than a common sponge. The springs of the comfy chair will bring better support and sitting feeling. 【MODERN DESIGN】Functional and stylish are the characteristics of this comfy chair. Armrests on both sides of the sitting chair make an ultimate in comfort. Elegant tufted linen upholstery with a modern low-profile design can be matched with various decoration styles. Whether placed in the bedroom or leisure areas, the midcentury modern accent chair will add more features to your house. 【ENJOY LIFE TIME】Are you worried about not being able to use the sofa chair in small spaces? The size of our room chair is moderate which can provide the perfect solution for small spaces. As a reading chair, it also has enough space to sit and read. You can relieve more fatigue when working and get more relaxed when reading or playing games. The mid century chair is the perfect companion for enjoying your time. 【EASY ASSEMBLE】All components are included in the package to be ready for installation. Just follow the steps in the instructions to install the 4 wooden legs on it, a perfect piece of furniture will appear in your home. If you have any problems with the quality, assembly, or spare parts of our sofa chair, please contact us at any time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dhuWeh9DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kingfun","source_asin":"B09TXLHP5T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596206","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TXLHP5T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TXLHP5T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
