window.products.push({"id":596259,"name":"Magnetic Foil and Plastic Wrap Organizer, 2PC Separate Plastic Wrap Dispenser with Cutter, Bamboo Tin Foil Cutter, Aluminum Foil Organization and Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oDy2lNF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIGUE MAGNETIC: Magnets to the back of each foil and plastic wrap organizer box so that it can be attached to any metal surface. And there is a hanging hole design at the bottom, you can put it in a drawer or hang it on the wall, very convenient for daily use MULTI SCENE USE & THICKER: 2.99 pounds is thicker and more durable than similar products, make your drawer neat and organized with this bamboo wrap dispenser holder box. The aluminum foil dispenser is designed specifically for your different wraps organization; SIZE: 13.8\" x 2.75\" x 2.75\". Compatible with plastic wrap, aluminum foil and wax paper; Not compatible with rolls that are wider than 12\"; The bamboo organizer is 3.27\" High; Measure your drawer first ROLLER DESIGN IS MORE STABLE: With fixed roller for every slot, it ensures hold each roll in place to keep it from losing the roll start during dispensing; The baggie organizer with sharp sliding cutter to ensures a clean cut; The downward inserted lid design to easier rolls install 2 SEPARATE BAGGIE ORGANIZER: This foil organizer set contains 2 separate foil dispensers, according to your needs, decide to use them alone or in combination. And 21 LABEL STICKERS can custom labels to mark the organizer to help you quickly find what you need; You can label the organizer clearly, or not use the labels to keep the clean look of the wraps holder BEST GIFT : Foil dispenser with cutter, the natural wood grain finishing touches create a modern aesthetic that will make your kitchen cabinets and drawers look more well-ordered. With a delicate gift packaging box is the perfect gift for families, friends, neighbors on any occasion like Thanksgiving, Christmas, wedding, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oDy2lNF1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EAZOO","source_asin":"B09Y1824KL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596259","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1824KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1824KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
