window.products.push({"id":596316,"name":"Cheese making Cheese molds Cheese making mold cheese Cheesemaking Cow Goat Milk Cheese molds Rennet cheesemaking Cheese Kitchen baskets Cheesecloth | ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NAEtMS8PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cheese making Cheese molds Cheese making mold cheese Cheesemaking Cow Goat Milk Cheese molds Rennet cheesemaking Cheese Kitchen baskets Cheesecloth | 0.88lbs Valance + Rectangle Original HOZPROM The CHEESE MOLD is a special device for the optimal technologically correct removal of whey and the formation of the cheese head not only in a beautiful shape, but also in a dense surface structure. The form for cheese determines the properties of a smooth closed surface that encloses complex biochemical processes in the cheese from environmental influences. The cheese molds are made of high-quality food-grade polymer, they form the head of the cheese of the correct form, provide drainage of cheese grains with the most effective outflow of whey. The equipment of our company for molding cheese, presented in the form of quality molds for the manufacture of soft and hard cheeses, will ensure the fulfillment of industrial tasks for the production of brine, semi-soft and hard cheeses. CHEESE MAKING MOLDS are intended for the preparation of such cheeses: Mozzarella, Mascaprane, Brie, Parmesan, Cambola, Camembert, Gorgonzola, Tete de Muan, Roquefort, Bocconcini, Burrata, Grana Padano, Castelmagno, Provolon, Ricotta, Talejo, Beaufort, Valenza Maasdam, Mildziter, Manchego, Radamer, Suluguni, Casot, Parmigiano, Dor Blu and many others.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91NAEtMS8PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hozprom Cheese Molds Manufacturer","source_asin":"B08G4DLFZ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08G4DLFZ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08G4DLFZ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":596317,"name":"RICCLE Fruit Basket For Kitchen Counter - 2 Tier Fruit Basket With Banana Hanger - Double Layer Metal Wire Fruit Bowl For Kitchen Countertop - Two Tie","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xiw1H75CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Space Efficient: The fruit basket is perfect under-the-cupboard height to hold all of your kitchen products in one convenient place rather than all over kitchen counters and window sill. The two tier fruit basket has a nice amount of space to keep fruit and vegetables organized with a holder hook to hang bananas Well-built metal framework: The high-quality wirework of the fruit organizer makes it sturdy to carry heavy loads without bending. The banana hanger can be alternatively attached in the middle or sideways of the basket depending on the size of the bananas. The coated footwork leaves no marks on the surface where it is placed and it can be used for decorative purposes around your home. Aesthetically Pleasing Design: The wire fruit basket is easy to assemble, well packaged, and can be placed on kitchen countertops, dining tables, or living rooms. The black color with better paint quality renders it rustproof and a unique space-saving design increases its functions, whether it can stack together as 2 tiers fruits/Veggie bins, or can be used separately as a large fruit bowl. Perfect Goldilocks size: Its modern design complements the decor and esthetics of an organized home while decluttering and organizing the work area. Tiered fruit baskets hold avocados, apples, pineapple, or whichever fruit you want, in one place and allow aerodynamic airflow to reduce spoilage to improve shell life. Another, a great option is placing it in your dorm rooms or a presenting it as a housewarming gift User-Friendly: You can easily grab fruit rather than sugary items every time you walk by the fruit and vegetable storage basket to maintain a healthy lifestyle and rest the rest of the family would too. It can be easily cleaned with a wet cloth and the added screw in the top tier with PVC cover provided along with a wench extradite its strength. Moreover, it doesn’t topple over when a kid grabs. The complementary fruit knife and the fruit peeler makes it the perfect choice","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xiw1H75CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RICCLE","source_asin":"B09QCR8LHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596317","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QCR8LHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QCR8LHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
