window.products.push({"id":596347,"name":"WOILLIO [Upgrade]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RruuaiTUL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","description":"If you have been looking for the optimal cost effective solution to transform your child's bedroom into a comfortable, happy and cozy paradise, congratulations, you have found it. With the help of our 3D glow-in-the-dark star stickers, you can give your children a warm bedroom experience. Safe Material Waterproof vinyl and non-toxic material, children can safely and securely use The 3D glow in the dark star provides a beautiful gift for your children. Perfect Design Perfect decorative design, the star wall sticker set is suitable for walls, glass, furniture and any flat surface. Removable DIY, create an entire galaxy of stars on the walls and ceiling of any room. Easy To Stick And Use High-quality double-sided tape allows for better adhesion of the stars to the location you want to stick them. Simply place the glowing star under a light source to absorb light for 15-30 minutes, turn off the light source and the star will glow in the dark. Your satisfaction is our NO.1 priority: Put the foam stickers to the back of the stars Stick to the place dark enough like wall or ceiling The stars are brighter when stuck near light source Stars are dim when stuck near the window Longer lighting time, brighter afterglow effect The luminous stars stickers need to absorb the light before glow. Please stick it in the place where the light can shine. After turning off the light, it will glow. It will definitely glow when you take glowing stars for ceiling into the dark after sunning, but if you wait a few hours in the evening, the fluorescent effect of the luminous stickers will be weak. Package Including: 100 Pcs Blue Glow Star Fluorescent Plastic Wall Stickers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RruuaiTUL._AC_SL1440_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WOILLIO","source_asin":"B08PV9TNN1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PV9TNN1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PV9TNN1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":596348,"name":"Bedream Ruffle Buffalo Check Shower Curtain with Wooden Buttons, Chic Decorative Shower Curtain for Restroom, Classy Fabric Bathroom Curtain with Wate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bKN5pj0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EASIEST WAY TO UPGRADE YOUR BATHROOM: Combined the classic buffalo plaid pattern with handcrafted waterfall ruffles, this ruffle shower curtain brightens up your bathroom and gives it the high-end, modern and rustic look. If you're looking for a farmhouse curtain with flair, you can't go wrong with the checkered shower curtain. BRING NATURAL DETAILS TO YOUR BATHROOM: 6 vintage coconut buttons in the middle to tie the top black and white checked pattern and bottom ruffles together. The adorable wooden button embellishments add a unique touch and country feeling, providing natural atmosphere to your room. IDEAL FOR GIFT: Comes in an exquisite box packaging, which is more upscale and delicate than regular bag package. It would be a good gift for your friend who loved farmhouse, rustic, French Country, vintage, feminine and boho style, as well as a wedding, Thanksgiving, Christmas, housewarming gift. OUTSTANDING FABRIC & EASY TO INSTALL: Made of premium brushed microfiber, the decorative fabric shower curtain is more textured and high-end than the PEVA shower curtain. 12 rust-free buttonholes on the top allow for easy installation, keep shower curtain in space. Exquisite sewing stitch and detail workmanship ensure sturdy and long lasting use. WHAT YOU CAN GET & CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Measures 72 x 72 inches fit most bathrooms. One package includes 1 ruffle shower curtain, NOT include hooks. Machine wash in cold water with gentle cycle. No bleach and tumble dry low. Due to the delicate nature of the design, DRY CLEAN is highly recommended. If there are some creases on shower curtain, please iron it gently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bKN5pj0yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedream","source_asin":"B0B2J5S485","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2J5S485","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2J5S485","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
