window.products.push({"id":596468,"name":"Over The Toilet Storage Shelf, Over-the-toilet Storage Rack, Over Toilet Bathroom Organizer Adhesive Wall Hanging Shelves with Toilet Paper Holder&Hoo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yQOWbVD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"😻【Cute Sturdy Over Toilet Bathroom Organizer】If you are trying to get your toiletries and skincare organized in the bathroom and this just made that possible! 100% anti-rust carbon steel, waterproof and anti-scratch, bearing up to 36Lbs, should last for years. 💪 【Powerful Suction Cup, Non-Slip Over Toilet】Fixed suction cups on both sides provide powerful suction that firmly grips smooth surfaces for safe, dependable, and long-lasting hold. Slightly wet it with a damp rag, and firmly push to activate the suction. 💕【2-tier Adjustable Bathroom Shelf 】With a heightened guardrail, there is no need to worry about items falling from the over toilet rack, and you can freely adjust the height with a different side rail. Open bottom mesh design allows air circulation and reduces dust build-up. 🔧【Foldable Design, Great Easy to Assemable】Easy no tool, no drilling, no screw install, this bathroom over-the-toilet organizer is assembly finished in three minutes, which is a great pick for bathrooms, kitchens, RVs, vanities, and where needs extra organization. ​ ⛑️【Adhesive Wall Hanging, Take Off Anytime】You have the option to hang this against the wall on top of the tank with 4 adhesive hooks. Two thick sticky hooks (placed in the parts bag) are fixed in the uppermost crossbar, and two thin sticky hooks are fixed in the middle or below the crossbar. 👁️【Warm Tips】(1) Before buying, please check the measurements of how small it would be on the back of your toilet. (2) Top curved water tank isn't conducive to this shelving unit. (3) Adhesive hook is only suitable for pasting on smooth surfaces (such as ceramic tile, marble, glass, metal, and mirror) 🙋‍♀️【Your Satisfaction Is Our Top Priority】FKmindyq over-the-toilet storage Organizer is a perfect spacesaver for the limited place. You will not just obtain this premium toilet storage rack, but also our long-lasting service. Any questions, please feel free to contact us! 🎁【Wonderful Gift Ideas】On Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Father's Day, St. Patrick's Day, Easter Day, 4th of July, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day, Christmas Day, New Year's Eve, Birthdays, Weddings, Graduations. Gift For Women, Men, Mom, Dad, Wife, Husband, Sister, Brother, Grandmother, or Girlfriend, Boyfriend.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yQOWbVD9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FKmindyq","source_asin":"B0BD249ZW4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596468","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD249ZW4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD249ZW4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
