window.products.push({"id":596496,"name":"T-fal Classic Avante 4-Slice Toaster, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617TpmE4KdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With its sleek, sophisticated design, this four-slice toaster not only looks great in any contemporary kitchen, but it also features extra-wide, self-adjusting slots that can accommodate various types of breads, including bagels, buns, and English muffins. Its user-friendly control panel offers simple push-button controls including a bagel function for toasting just the cut side, a reheat setting to warm already toasted bread, and a cancel option to end the session at any time. Choose from six electronic browning-control settings from light to dark by turning the knob. Double levers and double control knobs make it possible to operate two of the slots independently from the other two slots. Even more, the toaster's slanted design allows for effortlessly keeping an eye on the process, plus makes for simple toast removal. For added convenience, the unit provides an anti-jam function that stops the toast cycle to ensure safe operation and a high-lift lever for removing smaller items. Other highlights include a safe-to-touch exterior, a pull-out crumb tray for quick cleanup, convenient cord storage, and an easy-access carrying handle. The toaster measures approximately 11-1/2 by 10 by 8-3/5 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617TpmE4KdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"T-fal","source_asin":"B001E9TO1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001E9TO1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001E9TO1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":596497,"name":"NOVICA Large Brown Romantic Suar Wood Sculpture, 11.75\" Tall 'My Heart and Yours'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":47.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710T1W7KyZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer.  About this item: Two hearts beat as one in this beautiful sculpture by Wayan Rendah. Joining lips in a fervent kiss, the couple's bodies merge and meld. The woman's long hair flows gracefully around them like a warm embrace.  - Signed by the artist - Each artwork is unique -- wood grain, color, and pattern will differ slightly from picture   About our Artist: Wayan Rendah's father began teaching him to sculpt when he was a boy. 'Balinese woodcarving touches me very deeply. I have learned a variety of arts in Bali, such as gamelan dance, but carving a piece of wood gives me an incomparable sensation,' he says. 'After I finished school, I studied further because I needed more experience, and the tools and material I needed were beyond my financial reach. Exploring the abstract world refreshes my mind in creating new carvings.'","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710T1W7KyZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B00444UMRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00444UMRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00444UMRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
