window.products.push({"id":596503,"name":"SINOMANN@RGBW LED Strip Lighting Kit 16.4ft 5M 5050 300leds waterproof Color Changing RGBW LED Flexible Lights + 40Key RGBW Remote Controller + 12V 5A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hij67eqxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"RGB + White strips are an evolution of the RGB stripes. In this new model, an RGB LED and a white LED is fitted alternately, it combines the best of both worlds, the variety of colors of RGB LEDs with the purity of the monochromatic LEDs. This allows you, by mixing those colors to create pastel shades, this expands the color selection enormously.  The various LED chips can be controlled separately for white light or different colors to illuminate the chosen installation location always perfect and according to the situation.  The color white, can be generated by the RGB LEDs inadequate. For this reason, RGB + White strips were designed.  White (This strip led is not 4 in 1 design) Traditional RGB strip light in the market give impurity white (composed with red green and blue) which means it is blue shift, red shift or green shift. Our RGBW gives you white color even could be used for reading or illumination.  2 in 1 design Designed with 150pcs RGB LEDs and 150pcs WHITE LEDs. Go work with RGBW controller can achieve multi-color gradual changing, jump changing, chasing effect or rolling effect. You also can shut down the white channel, and then you get a normal RGB strip light.   Specifications:  Color: RGB+ White  LED Quantity: 60LEDs/m, 300LEDs/roll(150pcs RGB LED and 150pcs White LED)  View angle: 120°  Voltage: 12V DC  Current: 5A/roll  Power: 60W /roll  Strip width: 10mm PCB Board  Working Temperature:-20 to 50°  Can be cut by 6 SMD LED  Waterproof IP20 Package Contents:  1x Waterproof RGBW LED strip 1x 40Key Remote Controller 1x 12V 6A Power Supply","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71hij67eqxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINOMANN","source_asin":"B01KVGO80K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596503","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KVGO80K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KVGO80K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
