window.products.push({"id":596518,"name":"Objet d'art Release #545 \"Trim The Tree\" Christmas Ornament Handmade Jeweled Enameled Metal Trinket Box","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ulozV3z0L._AC_SL1032_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer Artform: n. “An undertaking or activity enhanced by a high level of skill or refinement.” In a world so focused on “advancing” technology, its rare to find a company and product dedicated to “turning back the clock”, by making things of beauty the old fashioned way; by hand. Introducing Artform Fine Collectibles. Based in exciting Las Vegas Nevada, and dedicated to the fine art of imagination. From humble beginnings, we have assembled one of the largest collections of unique collectible trinket boxes in compelling categories of interest, such as our famous “gambling and Vegas”, critically endangered species, “America’s Heroes”, musical instruments, “World Heritage Sites and many many more. There exists a must have product for everyone in this expansive catalogue. Using age-old techniques of metalworking and precision jewelery making, this beautiful line of handmade collectibles embody the dedication and com- mitment of our skilled artisans; making every one we produce, singularily unique; each a keepsake worth cherishing for a lifetime. It all starts with our hundreds of unique designs, inspired by life and forged into miniature. An idea becomes a sketch and the process begins as hand-cast fine pewter is forged into a shell skillfully prepared, precious metal plated, enameled and embellished with fine Austrian crystal, all 100% by hand. “A permanent, tangible expression of love”, we call these beautiful curios. So much more meaningful and expressive than a greeting card. They become the perfect gift; matched to the dreams and passions of the recipient; beautifully packaged in our signature handmade giftbox with embossed certificate of authenticity and fine linen presentation card and matching envelope. Un- matched in quality; a gift worth giving for any occasion. We call all of this “objet d’art”; or “work of art”, limited only by the boundaries of your imagination . . .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ulozV3z0L._AC_SL1032_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Objet d' Art","source_asin":"B075CGK645","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596518","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075CGK645","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075CGK645","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
