window.products.push({"id":596618,"name":"Gourmet Styles | Traditional Handmade Natural Bamboo Steamer Basket 10 inch, 2 Baskets, Side Handles, Wax Liners & Chopsticks | 2 Tier Food Pot Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vEsc-iMeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"What's in the box? 1 x 10\" Diameter Handmade Natural Bamboo Steamer with Side Handles 1 x 10\" Diameter Handmade Natural Bamboo Steamer with Side Handles 50 wax liners 50 wax liners 1 x Pair of premium wooden chopsticks 1 x Pair of premium wooden chopsticks How Does It Work? Steaming food is a traditional and very simple process. This steamer is designed to sit over a pot containing simmering water so that the steam rises through the open slats in the bottom. The steam is contained by the lid, cooking your food in the process. Incredible health benefits! The process of steaming food has been proven to help retain the foods original texture, flavors & most importantly it's nutrients! How To Care For Your Bamboo Steamer It is very important you do not use a dishwasher to clean your Bamboo Steamer, as the natural bamboo material is not designed to be dishwasher safe. Thankfully it couldn't be easier to clean, simply wash with a cloth dipped in warm, plain water. For more stubborn smells use a half a cup of vinegar in one gallon of hot water to wipe over the food steamer. NEVER use abrasive chemicals, solvents or detergents as this may damage the bamboo surface. Always make sure you let your bamboo steamer completely dry putting it away. What Can I Cook In My New Steamer? You can cook a whole manner of foods in this steaming basket. We have personally cooked seafood (fish & crab), asparagus, broccoli, dim sum, dumplings, rice, chicken, pork, beef and various other veggies. You can cook items from the fridge or freezer, although frozen items will take longer. What will be your favorite dish?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91vEsc-iMeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yinat","source_asin":"B07VZN86RC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VZN86RC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VZN86RC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
