window.products.push({"id":596675,"name":"Blender for Kitchen, Nut Milk Maker Machine,Smoothie Maker,Food Processor, Baby Food Blender,Juicer,Professional-Grade, with Heating Function and Time","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":126.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tJPFHOFfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【9 Speed Control & 1200W High Powerful Motor】-〖How to use〗Our hot and cold blender didn't come with a recipe, Because our product design is simple and practical , press the corresponding menu function key, and then press the Start button, the time has been set. As for the taste you according to your own preference The menu buttons don't have a heating function except for \"fruit and vequtable\" and \"smoothie\", which are good for cold drinks. The other menu keys all have heating function 【Cold/Hot Food Full-Function Blender】 - Professional Countertop blender provides you various culinary modes,food can be cold blend or boiled. You can easily make all kinds of delicious food: fruit and vegetable juice ,Curry ,Jam, salad,soy milk, rice cereal supplement,baby Food,stew,thick soup,grain porridge,corn juice,smoothie etc. 【Schedule Timer Blender】fresh and delicious soup, thick grain porridge and steaming soy milk can be cooked by automatic cooking blender for you.You don't have to get up early to make breakfast and just set the prep time in advance and you can enjoy a hearty delicious breakfast in the morning. 【Automatic Cleaning】Wave Crusher Blender don't need to hand wash after use.The jug blender can be cleaned automatically by adding 1/3 of water and a few drops of detergent with One Touch into cleaning mode,then not any stains will be remained on the glass jug wall! 【Safety Protection Function】The motor can only work when the jug is combined with the motor and the magnetic induction cover is covered.Once motor overheat or the jug separated from the machine ,the machine will automatic stop working,which is very safe .Multiple heat dissipation system support motor to discharge heat which extend the working life of the motor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tJPFHOFfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Iluckyla","source_asin":"B0BG125G84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BG125G84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BG125G84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
