window.products.push({"id":596680,"name":"Bettabode Set of 3 Hexagon Shelves – Wood Honeycomb Shelves, Wall Decor for Living Room, Bedroom – Modern Wall Mount Hexagon Floating Shelves – Floati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fhh0UqmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You know that something's been missing from that wall for a long time now. But with our set of 3 hexagon shelves, you can finally decorate it after your own wishing and explore different ideas and styles in the process. See All The Remarkable Benefits and Features Of Our Hexagon Shelves: ✅ Highly Versatile Design: each of the 3 hexagon wood shelves has a different dimension, allowing you to create a unique pattern and wall decoration. Use the hexagon spacing tool and spirit level to align the shelves exactly how you want while maintaining esthetic proportions. ✅ Perfect for DIY Projects: the natural color of this solid wood makes a great base for painting or staining. Whenever you feel like redecorating your house, our honeycomb shelves can easily be customized to match the new decor. ✅ Decorating with Style: the hexagonal shape of these shelves will perfectly complement various room settings. The smooth finishes and straight lines can highlight an elegant room decor or bring an extra edge to a modern, minimalist living room. ✅ Easy & Safe Wall Mounting: unlike other hexagon shelves that have mounting hooks on the exterior, ours are built-in, making the shelves completely flush on the wall. Your setting will be safer and look neater. ✅ Bonus Decorative Items: display more ornaments or further personalize your wall decor with the help of our removable shelf and wood photo frame. ✅ Instructions & Installation Kit: if this is your first decorating project, don't worry. We got your back every step of the way! In the package, you will find step-by-step instructions for mounting and aligning the shelves. Plus, all the tools you need in the process. Bring Your Decoration Ideas To Life With The Help Of Our 3 Hexagon Shelves. Click “Add To Cart” Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Fhh0UqmKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bettabode","source_asin":"B09MDWCHHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596680","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MDWCHHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MDWCHHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
