window.products.push({"id":596741,"name":"mermaker Velvet Duvet Cover Set Queen Size, 3 Piece Comforter Cover Set, Warm Winter Luxury Velvet Bedding Set with Zipper Closure (Queen, Denim Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KAk2VScRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This locking mailbox insert adds a locking compartment inside your standard 6\" mailbox to make casual mail theft much more difficult. It's an effective visual deterrent, plus it creates an obstacle that tells the thief to move on to an easier target.This small locking insert measures approx 5.75\" wide x 4.75\" high x 18\" deep Mail delivery slot size: 5.75\" wide x 1.25\" high Mailbox opening must be at least 5.75\" wide (L-R)  Newly re-designed with a stronger lock and more secure door design Sturdy construction with 14 gauge steel doors and 16 gauge steel bodies. Three keys included. Mail gets pushed through slot. Slot bent inward to restrict a hand from reaching in to easily steal your mail.These are not vaults, but they do protect mail from a casual thief and it will offer an excellent visual deterrent. Once a mail thief sees your lockbox, they'll probably move on to an unsecured mailbox. Junk mail and oversize items can be placed in the unsecured area above the lockbox. *NO MAILBOX INCLUDED. This listing is just for the locking insert. Includes 2 keys and the stainless steel screw/locknut fasteners. Installation requires drilling just one hole in your mailbox floor.***Local USPS approval is recommended.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61KAk2VScRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mailbox Lockbox","source_asin":"B077SK323Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596741","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077SK323Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B077SK323Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
