window.products.push({"id":596840,"name":"Neoflam 12-Inch Eela Frying Pan with Bakelite Handle and Ecolon Non-Stick Coating, Ivory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uXW6XX5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eela, winner of the 2012 iF Product Design Award, possesses a graceful pleated wall, seamlessly-integrated handles, and stylized bakelite lid knob make it nothing short of functional artistry. Regarded as Neoflam's flagship cookware line, Eela is feature rich and extremely lightweight. Eela's cutting edge design and color make it the least boring piece of cookware in your arsenal. Eela's cast aluminum design provides multiple advantages over its competitors; known for its exceptional durability and high heat conductivity, cast aluminum is rising in popularity as a safe and affordable alternative to stainless steel. At just 1/3 the weight of cast iron, cast aluminum's even heat distribution properties allow for fast cooking and reduced energy consumption. Made in Korea. What is Ecolon™ coating? Ecolon™ by Neoflam is a professional grade non-stick, ceramic coating. Derived from the earth's minerals, Ecolon™ is PFOA free. Ecolon™ is applied to both the interior and exterior of the product, sustaining the product's durability while also facilitating convenience in cleaning. About Neoflam Neoflam is dedicated to bringing forth innovative kitchenware and household products that are healthy . Each product is engineered to have both exceptional design and performance; Neoflam's leadership in product design has been recognized by the following prestigious design awards: iF (2012), Red Dot (2012,2013,2014), and Design Plus (2014).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uXW6XX5zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neoflam","source_asin":"B00OAYN4GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596840","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00OAYN4GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00OAYN4GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
