window.products.push({"id":596928,"name":"Crisky Groomsman Gift Box with Silver Foiled Text | Set of 1 Empty Boxes | Perfect for Will You Be My Bestman Gift and Wedding Present","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+LGn085NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Crisky Groomsman Gift Box Congrats on getting engaged! Now it’s time to propose to your groomsman with these beautiful modern boxes. Each black and silver box are high quality and makes a beautiful keepsake box to cherish forever. Get creative and fill the box with meaningful items that your groomsman will love. Whether you include a card, and a bottle of champagne, small tools, your groomsman will be impressed with how lovely the packaging box looks! Size: 10x10x3.5 inches These stylish boxes are the perfect size for gifting a small champagne bottle, wine glass, tools, , bottle opener, and or a hangover kit. Quantity: set of 1 “bestman” empty gift box These pretty boxes are embellished with silver shiny “thank you for being my bestman” message in the box. Perfect box to add your creative original touch by adding personalized goodies. Material: Hardboard Paper - 1200 gsm Made from premium reinforced high quality natural Kraft paper which is wrapped in 200gsm white paper. These boxes will not warp from holding heavy items such as bottles. Included in Your Package: 1 Pcs  “thank you for being my bestman” box 100% Satisfaction Guarantee: 1 year warranty. If you are not completely satisfied with our product, please contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+LGn085NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crisky","source_asin":"B07CL1NHBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-596928","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CL1NHBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CL1NHBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
